3 | RESULTS AND DISCUSSIONS
\end{title}

The stability of unknown phase are examined by the thermodynamically,53,54 as well as the dynamically.55 The thermodynamic stability of the TiH2 is examined by the formation enthalpy (ΔH),56,57 which is given by

\begin{equation}
\Delta H(\mathrm{T i H}_{2})=\frac{1}{3}\left(E_{\mathrm{t o t a l}}(\mathrm{T i H}_{2})-E_{\mathrm{T i}}-E_{\mathrm{H}2}\right),
\end{equation}

where Etotal(TiH2), ETi and EH2 are the calculated total energy of TiH2, isolated Ti and H2. The dynamical stabil- ity is seen by our previous work.58,59

